For a brief moment your whole body becomes etheral and you dash into a nearby creature and all those in straight line behind it (in range [2, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)]).

You reappear on the other side, with [14, 28, 42, 56, 70 (TL1-5)] more psi and having dealt [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage to your targets.
